  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bangsamoro peace process is at a critical stage as it approaches the end of its transition period in 2025. The interim Bangsamoro Government is focused on delivering key initiatives, but urgent attention is needed for marginalized and vulnerable communities. The Programme on Stabilization, Peace and Resilience in the Bangsamoro (PROSPER-Bangsamoro) aims to:- Facilitate technical and operational support to BARMM ministries, offices and agencies (MILG, MPOS, PSRO) and local government units in</narrative>
  </description>
